        ecrm:P3_has_note    "These gloves are knitted from red silk yarn and yellow silk partially wrapped with silver strip in stocking stitch. Made for a bishop, they are decorated geometric designs and a cross.  There are 23 stitches/20 rows per inch. The gloves are embellished with silver-gilt bobbin lace."@en ;
